{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.3"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-031",
    "title": "天门初鸣"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_174",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "陆照临发现其中一串属于一个从未见过的孩子，脚印一路通向天门，又折返回山脚。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "第三盏灯点亮后，回川城只剩一夜。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5445,
          "end": 5445
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城中所有姓名牌同时变成空白，街上的人却没有立刻消失。他们仍能走、能说话、能认出自己的屋子，只是每当有人叫出一个名字，声音便会被钟楼的青光吞掉。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5447,
          "end": 5447
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临站在塔顶，手里的无名小灯没有点燃。第一盏、第二盏和第三盏灯围着他缓慢旋转，灯火交错，像三条互相纠缠的锁链。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5449,
          "end": 5449
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻从楼梯上来，脸色苍白：“封天令还能撑多久？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5451,
          "end": 5451
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“到子时。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5453,
          "end": 5453
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“现在距离子时还有两个时辰。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5455,
          "end": 5455
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“够救多少人？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5457,
          "end": 5457
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“看你愿意让谁记住自己。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5459,
          "end": 5459
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临回头看城内。顾长离正在街心分发铜针，让居民把针尾缺口对准自己的屋门。叶观澜带着几名归墟盟成员守住东门，阻止玄霄宗的封锁队伍进入。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5461,
          "end": 5461
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们准备怎么做？”慧闻问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5463,
          "end": 5463
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“让人离开。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5465,
          "end": 5465
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“离开城，记忆会在路上崩散。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5467,
          "end": 5467
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“留在城里呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5469,
          "end": 5469
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“成为封天令的锚。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5471,
          "end": 5471
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“总要有选择。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5473,
          "end": 5473
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻把无相铜镜递给他：“镜子可以把一段记忆留在城外，但只能留一段。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5475,
          "end": 5475
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“留谁的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5477,
          "end": 5477
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“由你决定。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5479,
          "end": 5479
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "钟楼下传来争吵。一个老人抱着孩子，指着顾长离喊：“她拿走了我的名字！”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5481,
          "end": 5481
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离没有辩解，只把铜针递回老人手里：“我没有拿。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5483,
          "end": 5483
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那为什么我记不得自己是谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5485,
          "end": 5485
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为有人替你做了选择。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5487,
          "end": 5487
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老人抬头看钟楼：“那你们为什么不把名字还回来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5489,
          "end": 5489
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看向陆照临：“因为还不回去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5491,
          "end": 5491
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把无相铜镜贴在钟楼石栏上。镜面浮出一条条名字，有的完整，有的只剩姓氏。最下方出现一个熟悉的名字：陆沉舟。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5493,
          "end": 5493
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他在城心。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5495,
          "end": 5495
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你确定？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5497,
          "end": 5497
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“镜子只照记忆，不照时间。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5499,
          "end": 5499
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可它一直在照他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5501,
          "end": 5501
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为你一直在记他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5503,
          "end": 5503
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第三盏灯的火焰忽然向外爆开，城中一半房屋的门同时打开。失名的人走出屋子，朝钟楼缓慢聚拢。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5505,
          "end": 5505
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜在东门大喊：“玄霄宗开始攻城！”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5507,
          "end": 5507
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "剑光穿过夜色，落在城墙上。灰袍修士带着十余名弟子进入城门，白玉令牌上浮出封天令的三方印记。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5509,
          "end": 5509
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆照临，封天令即将失效。”他喊，“交还残印，玄霄宗会保存回川城居民的记忆。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5511,
          "end": 5511
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“保存在哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5513,
          "end": 5513
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“宗门的记忆库。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5515,
          "end": 5515
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁能保证他们拿得回来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5517,
          "end": 5517
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士沉默了一瞬：“宗门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5519,
          "end": 5519
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜冷笑：“又是宗门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5521,
          "end": 5521
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士挥剑，弟子们结成阵势。剑光所过，居民纷纷倒地，身体没有受伤，眼神却变得茫然。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5523,
          "end": 5523
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离冲到街心，铜针连出，击偏三道剑气。她肩上的债契黑纹已经爬到耳后，名字正在从她的记忆里剥落。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5525,
          "end": 5525
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾长离！”陆照临喊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5527,
          "end": 5527
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她回头：“我还记得。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5529,
          "end": 5529
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记得什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5531,
          "end": 5531
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你叫陆照临。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5533,
          "end": 5533
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“还有呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5535,
          "end": 5535
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你父亲叫陆沉舟。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5537,
          "end": 5537
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她的声音越来越低：“我叔父……叫顾——”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5539,
          "end": 5539
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "后面的字没有说出来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5541,
          "end": 5541
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临从塔顶跃下，掌心残印与两枚石片同时发亮。青光凝成一道屏障，将城心和街道分开。玄霄宗剑阵撞上屏障，整座城的地面随之震动。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5543,
          "end": 5543
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临想回答北河城，却发现这个地名已经在脑中变得陌生。他只能看见一条雨中的街、一棵模糊的树和一扇没有关严的门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-080",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5816,
          "end": 5816
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我从灯下走来。”他说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-081",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5818,
          "end": 5818
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "孩子摇头：“你是被灯送来的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-082",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5820,
          "end": 5820
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离握住他的手：“别听它。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-083",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5822,
          "end": 5822
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它说的也许是真的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-084",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5824,
          "end": 5824
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“真话也可能不是你的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-085",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5826,
          "end": 5826
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把白灯举高，火焰照向天门。黑暗中的灯群同时后退，陆沉舟的身影被推回门内。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-086",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5828,
          "end": 5828
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "只剩灯火。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-087",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5830,
          "end": 5830
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "天门初鸣并未震碎山河，只让每个人心里多出一声回响。陆照临站在门下，听见回响来自不同方向：有人呼救，有人命令，有人只是轻轻叹息。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-088",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5832,
          "end": 5832
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "后来者可以从这里开始，也可以选择另一条路。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-089",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5834,
          "end": 5834
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-090",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5836,
          "end": 5836
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "石阶上的脚印在夜雨中逐渐清晰。陆照临发现其中一串属于一个从未见过的孩子，脚印一路通向天门，又折返回山脚。他循迹找到孩子时，孩子正把一块写有自己名字的木牌埋进土里。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-091",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5838,
          "end": 5838
        }
      }
    ],
